 "description": "Diagnose why an x402 payment did not convert from quote to settled response: missing X-PAYMENT header, payTo/network/amount mismatch, wallet spend-cap block, verify failure, settle failure, or post-payment response delivery issue. This deterministic endpoint can inspect a live quote without paying the target endpoint and never sends a payment header to the target service. GET variant for agents that prefer query parameters. Pay $0.006 per request with x402 exact USDC on Base or Solana when advertised. Canonical live prices: https://gpt55.558686.xyz/x402/live-prices.json.",
